  "title": "Data Science & Machine Learning with Microsoft Fabric",
  "description": "Explore Microsoft Fabric’s unified Data Science experience in this fast-paced 25-minute demo. See how to ingest and prepare data with OneLake and Lakehouse, build models using Notebooks, Spark, and SynapseML, and track experiments with MLflow. Learn how to operationalize models with batch scoring and integrate results into Power BI. The session also showcases building a simple generative AI Q&A solution using Fabric Data Agents, giving you a practical end-to-end view in a short time.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
